WEBVTT

00:04:59.917 --> 00:05:01.768
But unfortunately,

00:05:01.792 --> 00:05:06.059
our relationship became unhinged
when I was released from prison.

00:05:06.083 --> 00:05:08.792
Post-traumatic stress syndrome,

00:05:10.167 --> 00:05:12.542
trauma from prior to going to prison,

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.809
baggage from her relationship,

00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.726
my inexperience in a relationship

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:24.167
undid the magic of what we built
behind the walls.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.292
Centered in all of that

00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:30.583
was our beautiful boy.